
# **Scoped Commits**
#
# <scope>: <description>
#
# <why this change is needed>
#
# The scope names where the change is: arto, markdown, config, keybindings,
# lsp, page, frontend, samples, schemas, platform, docs, adr, spec, agents,
# build, ci, nix, deps — the table in AGENTS.md says what each covers.
# Several scopes are joined with ", "; a change across the tree is "treewide".
#
# The description is lower case, without a trailing period, within 72
# characters. The body says why; a breaking change ends with a
# "BREAKING CHANGE:" trailer.
#
# **Install**
#
#   git config commit.template .gitmessage
